%% Campus Loop — every open request has a visible next owner
flowchart TD
    A[Student submits query] --> B[Create ticket ID and acknowledge]
    B --> C{Required information present?}
    C -- No --> D[Needs information: ask student]
    D --> E[Student adds details]
    E --> C
    C -- Yes --> F{Duplicate likely?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Link to existing ticket; human verifies]
    G --> H[Assigned owner reviews]
    F -- No --> I[Route by category to accountable owner]
    I --> J{Owner accepts handoff?}
    J -- No --> K[Reminder and intake coordinator escalation]
    K --> I
    J -- Yes --> H
    H --> L{Formal approval required?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Authorised approver decides]
    M --> N[Owner sends response and logs outcome]
    L -- No --> N
    N --> O{Student confirms resolved?}
    O -- No --> P[Reopen or escalate]
    P --> H
    O -- Yes --> Q[Close and retain minimal audit trail]
    R[Routing/tool failure] -.-> S[Monitored manual queue and reconciliation]
    I -. failure .-> R
    style M fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b
